# 預設依平台；下列檔案一律 LF（Git Bash / CI 的 sh 與 make 遇到 CRLF 會壞）
* text=auto
Makefile text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
api/mvnw text eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
# Windows 專用腳本保留 CRLF
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.jar binary
